<title>JAPAN: ASAHI BEER SYSTEM - 6MTH PARENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>ASAHI BEER SYSTEM - 6MTH PARENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  4.26		vs	    3.81</p>
<p> Operating	  116    million    vs	   83    million</p>
<p> Current	     80    million    vs	   77    million</p>
<p> Net		   20    million    vs	   14    million</p>
<p> EPS		    3.67 yen	  vs	    2.56 yen</p>
<p> Shares		6 million	  vs	   6 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Asahi Beer System Ltd is an operator of beer halls and restaurants.</p>
